## K-th Largest/Smallest Element

### Find K-th Largest Element

#### C++ Implementation
```cpp
// Using min heap of size k
int findKthLargest(vector<int>& nums, int k) {
    priority_queue<int, vector<int>, greater<int>> minHeap;

    for (int num : nums) {
        minHeap.push(num);
        if (minHeap.size() > k) {
            minHeap.pop();
        }
    }

    return minHeap.top();
}
```

#### Python Implementation
