## Tree Representation

### Node Structure

#### C++ Definition
```cpp
struct TreeNode {
    int val;
    TreeNode* left;
    TreeNode* right;
    TreeNode(int x) : val(x), left(nullptr), right(nullptr) {}
};
```

#### Python Definition
